  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 904.01 Fines Relating to Hazardous Waste Statutory Violations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 904.01 Fines Relating to Hazardous Waste Statutory Violations. For violating any requirement set out in RSA 147-A, the proposed fine shall be $2,000 per violation, event, unit, requirement, or provision of an administrative order, or any combination thereof.\n\nSource. #13784, eff 10-21-23; ss by #14283, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
